# Drop your real images here, then import them in the relevant component.
#
# Recommended:
#   • Profile photo:  ~800×1000px (4:5),  JPG or WebP,  < 300 KB
#   • Project images: 1600×900px (16:9),  JPG or WebP,  < 400 KB each
#   • Prefer .webp for the best size/quality; .jpg is a safe fallback.
#
# Importing (Vite handles hashing + paths automatically):
#   import portrait from "../assets/images/portrait.jpg";
#   ...then set  profileImage: portrait  in src/data/site.js
#
# This file just keeps the folder in git. You can delete it once you add images.
